 429: beside it (3 = 3). Seat B also names seven verified-sound areas in its raw output â€” the
 430: fail-closed oracle coverage, the fixture discipline, AT-001.10's discriminating pair,
 431: AT-001.09's ordering, the bookkeeping counts, the refactor's neutrality, and the selftest-lane
 432: placement â€” recorded here as evidence, not as findings. Every claim below is quoted verbatim
