 483: **[A5] â€” ACCEPT, FIXED DIFFERENTLY, with a verification condition.** Seat A (medium): "The
 484: stale-worktree probe accepts any non-404 response as the current `complete-signup` function."
 485: The fact is right â€” the probe fails only on 404 or unreachable, and a stale mount answers 401.
 486: The proposed remedy â€” a verifiable revision/source marker in the mounted artifact â€” buys
