GREEN HERE CLAIMS: that any deployed route enforces the Discovery gate - none exists, and\n# no check below exercises discoveryMessageAllowed; that hosted email delivery works - only the\n# local mail catcher was read; that any screen exists; anything about link expiry, single use or\n# resend - retired AT-001.11's semantics, deliberately unasserted; or anything about a provider\n# (Google, GitHub) user's verified state - no OAuth credential exists in this environment.\n#\n# THREE MEASUREMENTS WORTH READING TWICE:\n#   1. GoTrue's pre-confirmation sign-in refusal is HTTP 400 with error_code \"email_not_confirmed\" -\n#      exactly the discriminator check (c) pins. The expectation was pinned BEFORE the run and did\n#      not have to be corrected afterwards.\n#   2. The mail catcher behind port 54324 is MAILPIT v1.30.2, measured by probing both known API\n#      shapes. The Inbucket shape answered 404.\n#   3. The tampered-token probe, check (b2): GoTrue answered the never-issued token with a 303 to\n#      the site URL, and auth.users.email_confirmed_at stayed NULL. The column is the fact; the\n#      status is recorded but not asserted on.\n\n\nmail catcher shape, measured: mailpit\n        catcher at http://127.0.0.1:54324 · GET /api/v1/info -> HTTP 200 \"{\\\"Version\\\":\\\"v1.30.2\\\",\\\"LatestVersion\\\":\\\"v1.30.7\\\",\\\"Database\\\":\\\"/tmp/mailpit-1786289347825166043.db\\\",\\\"DatabaseSize\\\":94208,\\\"Messages\\\":0,\\\"Unread\\\":0,\\\"Tags\\\":{},\\\"RuntimeStats\\\":{\\\"Uptime\\\":161,\\\"Memory\\\":11540744,\\\"M\" · GET /api/v1/mailbox/probe -> HTTP 404 \"File not found\\n\"\n\nPASS  (a) an email/password signup under enable_confirmations = true returns NO session, and auth.users.email_confirmed_at is NULL\n        signup HTTP 200 {\"id\":\"2b5c6886-e9fe-4a22-90ff-3881d08227a3\",\"aud\":\"authenticated\",\"role\":\"authenticated\",\"email\":\"ngo-verify+mslynhy3@example.test\",\"phone\":\"\",\"confirmation_sent_at\":\"2026-08-09T15:31:50.269847917Z\",\"app_metadata\":{\"provider\":\"email\",\"providers\":[\"email\"]},\"user_metadata\":{\"email\":\"ngo-verify+mslynhy3@example.test\",\"email_verified\":false,\"phone_verified\":false,\"sub\":\"2b5c6886-e9fe-4a22-90ff-3881d08227a3\"},\"identities\":[{\"identity_id\":\"49acf32a-b7ac-4c52-9309-78218a41d324\",\"id\":\"2b5c6886-e9fe-4a22-90ff-3881d08227a3\",\"user_id\":\"2b5c6886-e9fe-4a22-90ff-3881d08227a3\",\"identity_data\":{\"email\":\"ngo-verify+mslynhy3@example.test\",\"email_verified\":false,\"phone_verified\":false,\"sub\":\"2b5c6886-e9fe-4a22-90ff-3881d08227a3\"},\"provider\":\"email\",\"last_sign_in_at\":\"2026-08-09T15:31:50.264516402Z\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-09T15:31:50.264554Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-09T15:31:50.264554Z\",\"email\":\"ngo-verify+mslynhy3@example.test\"}],\"created_at\":\"2026-08-09T15:31:50.257063Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-09T15:31:50.281371Z\",\"is_anonymous\":false} · carried a session: false · user id read from the response · auth.users.email_confirmed_at = NULL\nPASS  (b) the local mail catcher holds a confirmation email for the address, and the verification link is extracted from it\n        catcher shape: mailpit · mailpit held 1 message(s) for ngo-verify+mslynhy3@example.test; 2 verify link(s) found · link source: emailed\nPASS  (b2) a verification link carrying a token GoTrue never issued confirms nothing\n        the \"token\" parameter of the emailed link was mutated inside its own alphabet · following the tampered link answered HTTP 303 -> http://127.0.0.1:3000#<redacted-fragment> · auth.users.email_confirmed_at immediately afterwards = NULL · this says nothing about expiry, single use or resend: the token followed was never issued\nPASS  (c) sign-in BEFORE confirmation is refused by Auth itself, with a CONFIRMATION-SPECIFIC refusal (a 4xx that is not 429, naming the unconfirmed state)\n        sign-in HTTP 400 · error_code=email_not_confirmed (expected email_not_confirmed) · message=\"Email not confirmed\" · redacted body: {\"code\":\"<redacted>\",\"error_code\":\"<redacted>\",\"msg\":\"Email not confirmed\"} — captured verbatim, this is the refusal text · the discriminator above is read from the in-memory body, because the redactor blanks error_code\nPASS  (d) following the verification link flips email_confirmed_at, sign-in then succeeds, and the SHIPPED emailVerifiedFromUser answers true on the real /auth/v1/user body\n        link follow HTTP 303 -> http://127.0.0.1:3000#<redacted-fragment> · email_confirmed_at before=NULL after=2026-08-09T15:31:50.433Z · sign-in after HTTP 200 (access token present: true) · /auth/v1/user HTTP 200 {\"id\":\"2b5c6886-e9fe-4a22-90ff-3881d08227a3\",\"aud\":\"authenticated\",\"role\":\"authenticated\",\"email\":\"ngo-verify+mslynhy3@example.test\",\"email_confirmed_at\":\"2026-08-09T15:31:50.433812Z\",\"phone\":\"\",\"confirmation_sent_at\":\"2026-08-09T15:31:50.269847Z\",\"confirmed_at\":\"2026-08-09T15:31:50.433812Z\",\"last_sign_in_at\":\"2026-08-09T15:31:50.534234Z\",\"app_metadata\":{\"provider\":\"email\",\"providers\":[\"email\"]},\"user_metadata\":{\"email\":\"ngo-verify+mslynhy3@example.test\",\"email_verified\":true,\"phone_verified\":false,\"sub\":\"2b5c6886-e9fe-4a22-90ff-3881d08227a3\"},\"identities\":[{\"identity_id\":\"49acf32a-b7ac-4c52-9309-78218a41d324\",\"id\":\"2b5c6886-e9fe-4a22-90ff-3881d08227a3\",\"user_id\":\"2b5c6886-e9fe-4a22-90ff-3881d08227a3\",\"identity_data\":{\"email\":\"ngo-verify+mslynhy3@example.test\",\"email_verified\":true,\"phone_verified\":false,\"sub\":\"2b5c6886-e9fe-4a22-90ff-3881d08227a3\"},\"provider\":\"email\",\"last_sign_in_at\":\"2026-08-09T15:31:50.264516Z\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-09T15:31:50.264554Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-09T15:31:50.264554Z\",\"email\":\"ngo-verify+mslynhy3@example.test\"}],\"created_at\":\"2026-08-09T15:31:50.257063Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-09T15:31:50.537216Z\",\"is_anonymous\":false} · the SHIPPED emailVerifiedFromUser says: true · the extractor's FALSE half is NOT exercised here: an unconfirmed user holds no session to read /auth/v1/user with\nPASS  (e) both email-capable types flow end to end under the flipped config: the NGO completes after confirmation, and the volunteer confirms, links GitHub and completes with its profile populated\n        NGO completion HTTP 200 {\"ok\":true,\"accountId\":\"2b5c6886-e9fe-4a22-90ff-3881d08227a3\",\"accountType\":\"ngo\",\"organizationId\":\"ffd1c7bb-471c-43b6-88e7-a4647d10d5af\"} · rows=[{\"account_type\":\"ngo\",\"name\":\"Riverside Shelter\",\"role\":\"admin\"}]\n        volunteer round trip: signup carried a session=false · confirmed before=NULL after=2026-08-09T15:31:50.895Z · sign-in before confirmation HTTP 400 · error_code=email_not_confirmed (expected email_not_confirmed) · message=\"Email not confirmed\", redacted body {\"code\":\"<redacted>\",\"error_code\":\"<redacted>\",\"msg\":\"Email not confirmed\"} · link source emailed (mailpit held 1 message(s) for volunteer-verify+mslynhy3@example.test; 2 verify link(s) found) · its own tampered-token probe: attempted=true email_confirmed_at afterwards=NULL · shipped emailVerifiedFromUser says true\n        volunteer completion HTTP 200 {\"ok\":true,\"accountId\":\"efd1789a-217a-4a1e-a269-c5020cded07a\",\"accountType\":\"volunteer\",\"organizationId\":null} · account=[{\"account_type\":\"volunteer\"}] · stored profile=[{\"github_handle\":\"octoverifier\",\"top_languages\":[\"TypeScript\",\"Python\",\"Go\"],\"repository_count\":9,\"contribution_summary\":\"stub import fixture: octoverifier has 9 public repositories, most recently in TypeScript — no GitHub API was called to produce this\",\"imported_at\":\"2026-08-09T15:31:51.110Z\"}] · the shipped stub's judgement for \"octoverifier\"={\"topLanguages\":[\"TypeScript\",\"Python\",\"Go\"],\"repositoryCount\":9,\"contributionSummary\":\"stub import fixture: octoverifier has 9 public repositories, most recently in TypeScript — no GitHub API was called to produce this\"}\nPASS  (f) the m