S_KEY_ID\":\"<REDACTED>\",\"S3_PROTOCOL_ACCESS_KEY_SECRET\":\"<REDACTED>\",\"S3_PROTOCOL_REGION\":\"local\",\"message\":\"\"}\n----- exit code: 0 -----\n\n===== the auth container AFTER the reset, re-read - the flip survives the container restart =====\n$ docker inspect supabase_auth_poancmeitlmxejofwzuu --format '{{range .Config.Env}}{{println .}}{{end}}' | Select-String -Pattern \"AUTOCONFIRM|RATE_LIMIT_EMAIL\"\n\nGOTRUE_RATE_LIMIT_EMAIL_SENT=360000\nGOTRUE_SMS_AUTOCONFIRM=true\nGOTRUE_MAILER_AUTOCONFIRM=false\n----- exit code: 0 -----\n\n===== bunx supabase functions serve - THE OPERATOR-SIDE BINDING OF THE MOUNT TO THIS WORKTREE =====\n# Gate 2 ruling [A5] asks for this record, and this is it. The stale-mount probe inside\n# proof-local.ts can tell REACHABILITY from a 404; it cannot tell WHICH directory the edge runtime\n# mounted. So the launch is written down instead of inferred.\n#\n# COMMAND: bunx supabase functions serve\n# WORKING DIRECTORY: C:\\Users\\nirdr\\Downloads\\ai4good\\.claude\\worktrees\\agent-aa95110cbeab31aa7\n# FLAGS: none. --no-verify-jwt is NOT passed, so the runtime verifies the caller's token exactly as\n#        it would in a deployment.\n# LAUNCHED: 2026-08-09 18:31:36 +03:00\n# PROCESS ID: 49328\n#\n# Its first lines of output, which name the two functions it mounted:\n2026-08-09T15:30:55.680974747Z Serving functions on http://127.0.0.1:54321/functions/v1/<function-name>\n2026-08-09T15:30:55.681020066Z  - http://127.0.0.1:54321/functions/v1/complete-signup\n2026-08-09T15:30:55.681022631Z  - http://127.0.0.1:54321/functions/v1/create-organization\n2026-08-09T15:30:55.681024475Z Using supabase-edge-runtime-1.74.2 (compatible with Deno v2.1.4)\n#\n# And the probe the proof script performs, run here by hand as well: an unauthenticated POST to\n# complete-signup answers HTTP 401 - a refusal, not a 404, so the function is being served.\n#\n# WHY THE MOUNT'S REVISION IS NOT LOAD-BEARING, verified in the tree before this run:\n#   git diff main...HEAD --stat -- supabase/functions/\n#     supabase/functions/_shared/verification.ts | 167 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n#     1 file changed, 167 insertions(+)\n#   complete-signup/index.ts imports only _shared/accounts.ts, _shared/github.ts and _shared/edge.ts.\n# This branch therefore changes nothing complete-signup imports, and every revision it could be\n# compared against is byte for byte the same code.\n#\n# STOPPED AFTER STEP 5 FINISHED, on purpose. A `functions serve` left alive against a worktree that\n# is later removed is the exact stale-mount hazard this file's own comment describes, and this item\n# has no further use for it: nothing else in the item calls an edge function, and continuous\n# integration has no database. The edge runtime CONTAINER that `supabase start` runs stays up and\n# still answers 401, which is the stack's normal state and not this launch.\n----- the serve process was stopped by the executor after step 5 -----","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":158,"totalLines":158,"truncated":false}},"title":"loop\\items\\AI4DEV-59\\stack-up.txt","time":{"start":1786290410278,"end":1786290410285}},"id":"prt_fe734920e001hrETZwHx3JONJu","sessionID":"ses_018cbdef8ffeIiDUqdR6dh2IlP","messageID":"msg_fe7347d31001c96tg63DqQs2yY"}}
