    AI4DEV-59: apply the twelve gate 2 rulings
    
    The draft-code gate was a panel of two blind seats. Twelve findings, ten
    distinct defects, all accepted. The rulings are plan.md section 8.
    
    [A5] verify-first, checked before any edit: `git diff main...HEAD --stat --
    supabase/functions/` reports ONE changed file, the new
    `_shared/verification.ts` (167 insertions), and `complete-signup/index.ts`
    imports only accounts.ts, github.ts and edge.ts. The condition holds, so the
    fixed-differently route stands.
    
    The fixes:
    
    - [A1] the shape selftest asserts /verif/i and /email/i on the reason of
      every malformed-caller refusal, not only on `ok`.
    - [A2]+[B1] new proof check (b2): a TAMPERED variant of the emailed link -
      its token mutated inside its own alphabet, so a token GoTrue never issued -
      is followed BEFORE the real one, and `email_confirmed_at` must still be
      NULL. It skips, never passes, when no link exists. The fixture header's
      mirror 2 now cites (b2) instead of (a)-(d), which measured only the
      positive half.
    - [A3] proof checks (c) and (e) need a CONFIRMATION-SPECIFIC refusal: a 4xx
      that is not 429, whose body names the unconfirmed state. The discriminator
      is read from the in-memory body, because the redactor blanks `error_code`,
      and is surfaced through a safe extraction.
    - [A4] check (e) requires `linkSource === 'emailed'` for the volunteer.
    - [A5] the stale-mount probe's comment states the revision-independence
      argument; stack-up.txt records the `functions serve` command and cwd.
    - [A6]+[B2] redaction covers three surfaces now: object bodies, STRINGS
      (JWT-shaped substrings and credential-named name=value pairs), and the
      printed location header, whose every query-parameter VALUE is replaced
      with the names kept.
    - [A7] the fixture header no longer calls verification.ts a module the edge
      functions import - it is the module the FUTURE Discovery route must
      import - and the accept/refusal sentence is scoped to PRODUCT judgements,
      naming the bookkeeping precondition refusals as the exception.
    - [A8] `provisionPlatformAdmin` marks its auth user CONFIRMED and mints no
      link, mirroring the only provisioning recipe this repository records.
    - [A9] the pull-request body states the current truth.
    - [B3] the b-file header: the other four ids belong to the session-and-reset
      leaf, three of them section C's, the wrong-password one section B's.
    
    `bun run typecheck` exits 0.

